                "title": "Core abstraction",
                "items": [
                    "StoreInterface defines add() and query(); ManagedStoreInterface adds setup()/drop() lifecycle",
                    "Retriever is a thin convenience layer over query()"
                ]
            },
            {
                "title": "Indexing",
                "items": [
                    "Document holds TextDocument input; Vectorizer converts it to a VectorDocument using Platform",
                    "Indexer runs the batch pipeline and writes the result into Store"
                ]
            },
            {
                "title": "Bridges",
                "items": [
                    "24 vector store backends behind one interface: databases, cloud search, self-hosted, local"
                ]
